---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Contact" tabTitle="Contact Nixon" path="/contact" showHr={false}>
    <p>The best way to get in touch is by email. For anything related to AI safety, please use <button type="button" class="copy-text" data-copy="nixon@bluedot.org" title="Click to copy">nixon@bluedot.org<span class="copy-text-done" aria-live="polite"></span></button>. For anything unrelated to AI safety, you can write to <button type="button" class="copy-text" data-copy="hello@nixonhanna.com" title="Click to copy">hello@nixonhanna.com<span class="copy-text-done" aria-live="polite"></span></button>.</p>
    <p>Anyone can book a meeting with me at <a href="/meet" data-turbo="false">nixonhanna.com/meet</a>. I only ask that you come in with a clear reason for why you booked and know what you want to get out of the call.</p>
    <p>For anonymous feedback (handled by <a href="https://www.admonymous.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Admonymous</a>), you can leave a message at <a
            href="/feedback" data-turbo="false">nixonhanna.com/feedback</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="h2">You didn't reply to my message…</h2>

    <p>Sorry! Please try sending me another email and hopefully I'll see it this time.</p>
</PageLayout>
